lock-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">Return 200 immediately; process payload in background.</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">API reference:</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">- webhooks.create(url, event_types, inbox_ids?, pod_ids?, client_id?, headers?) (event_types is required and non-empty)</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">- webhooks.get(webhook_id), webhooks.get_headers(webhook_id), webhooks.list(limit?, page_token?)</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">- webhooks.update(webhook_id, add_inbox_ids?, remove_inbox_ids?, add_pod_ids?, remove_pod_ids?, event_types?, enabled?)</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">- webhooks.update_headers(webhook_id, headers?, remove_headers?)</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">- webhooks.delete(webhook_id)</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">- scoped variants: pods.webhooks.* (pod_id) and inboxes.webhooks.* (inbox_id) — same CRUD, scope from the path</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">Events: message.received, message.received.spam, message.received.blocked, message.received.unauthenticated, message.sent, message.delivered, message.bounced, message.complained, message.rejected, message.opened, message.security.completed, message.security.review, message.security.override, domain.verified, calendar.event.created, calendar.event.updated, calendar.event.deleted, calendar.event.responded, calendar.event.starting, calendar.event.ending (calendar events need calendar_event_read)</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">Payload: event_type, event_id, plus message/send/delivery/bounce/complaint/reject/domain; calendar.event.* carry inbox_id and calendar_event. Verify with Svix (webhook.secret).</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">Custom delivery header values are write-only. get_headers returns names only; update_headers rotates or removes them.</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">Note: message.received.spam, message.received.blocked, and message.received.unauthenticated are excluded by default. To receive them, explicitly include them in event_types and ensure the API key has the label_spam_read / label_blocked_read / label_unauthenticated_read permission for each.</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">On update, non-empty event_types replaces the subscribed list in full; omit it to leave types unchanged ([] is rejected with 400).</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">message.received* inlines the body only up to 64 KiB of stored body; above that, text/html/extracted_* are omitted and body_url (valid 1 hour) + body_expires_at are sent.</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#8a8a8a;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">Delivery is at least once: dedupe on event_id (same across retries and across webhooks), not svix-id. Retries: 8 attempts over ~27.5h; an endpoint failing for 5 days is disabled (enabled: false) with no notification; re-enable with enabled=True.</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span class="code-block-line-content"><span class="line"><span data-fern-style="color:#C2C3C5;font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span></span></div><div class="code-block-line"><span c