<div class="fern-card-group my-6 grid gap-3 first:mt-0 sm:gap-4 grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2"><a data-astro-prefetch="viewport" class="fern-card interactive not-prose rounded-3 relative block border text-base p-6" href="/events"><div class="fern-card-icon-row fern-card-icon-row-fixed flex items-start flex-col space-y-3" data-fern-style="--card-icon-color:var(--accent-a10);--card-icon-dark-color:var(--accent-a10);--card-icon-size:32px"><div class="w-full space-y-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="text-body text-base font-semibold">Webhook Events</div><div class="text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><p>Explore the full list of available event types and their data payloads.</p></div></div></div></a><a data-astro-prefetch="viewport" class="fern-card interactive not-prose rounded-3 relative block border text-base p-6" href="/webhook-verification"><div class="fern-card-icon-row fern-card-icon-row-fixed flex items-start flex-col space-y-3" data-fern-style="--card-icon-color:var(--accent-a10);--card-icon-dark-color:var(--accent-a10);--card-icon-size:32px"><div class="w-full space-y-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="text-body text-base font-semibold">Verifying Webhooks</div><div class="text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><p>Learn how to verify webhook signatures to secure your endpoints.</p></div></div></div></a><a data-astro-prefetch="viewport" class="fern-card interactive not-prose rounded-3 relative block border text-base p-6" href="/websockets"><div class="fern-card-icon-row fern-card-icon-row-fixed flex items-start flex-col space-y-3" data-fern-style="--card-icon-color:var(--accent-a10);--card-icon-dark-color:var(--accent-a10);--card-icon-size:32px"><div class="w-full space-y-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="text-body text-base font-semibold">WebSockets</div><div class="text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><p>Receive events over a persistent connection with no public URL required.</p></div></div></div></a><a data-astro-prefetch="viewport" class="fern-card interactive not-prose rounded-3 relative bloc